.formula U|xmonth       = F|month(U|xdate)
..
..
.formula U|xtdat = "tmp/XDEPR."+'U|xyear'+"."+'U|xmonth'+".EDP"
.formula U|xterrdat = 'U|xtdat'+".ERR"
..
